{"images":[{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/DL380p%20Gen8/HP%20ProLiant%20DL380P%20Gen8%20Server-476x476.jpg.webp","alt":"HP ProLiant DL380P Gen8 Server","width":476,"height":476}],"thumbs":[],"labels":[],"banner":{"href":null,"image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Slider%20Image/OTECH-Home-delivery-1040x200.jpg.webp","alt":"Home Delivery","width":0,"height":0}},"title":"HP ProLiant DL380P Gen8 Server","stats":[{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Regular Price :","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Product ID : 804","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"product-stock in-stock","label":"Status:","value":"In Stock","href":null,"plain":false},{"cls":"product-manufacturer","label":"Brands:","value":"HP","href":"/hp","plain":false},{"cls":"product-model","label":"Model:","value":"DL380p Gen8","href":null,"plain":false},{"cls":"product-sku","label":"SKU:","value":"Refurbished","href":null,"plain":false}],"minimum":"","price":{"new":"","old":"","single":"","tax":"","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":true,"productId":"804","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: DL380p Gen8","c":[]},{"h":"Server Type: Rack Server (2U)","c":[]},{"h":"Processor: Intel Xeon E5-2600 Series","c":[]},{"h":"Memory: DDR3 HP SmartMemory","c":[]},{"h":"Storage: SFF / LFF configurations","c":[]},{"h":"Storage Interface: SAS / SATA","c":[]},{"h":"RAID: HP Smart Array controller options","c":[]},{"h":"Expansion: PCIe","c":[]},{"h":"Power Supply: Redundant PSU options","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The HP ProLiant DL380p Gen8 Server is a versatile enterprise rack server that combines scalable computing performance, flexible storage, and advanced management features in a 2U chassis. It is suitable for businesses, IT infrastructure, hosting environments, and data centers requiring dependable server hardware.</p><p><br></p><p>Powered by Intel Xeon E5-2600 series processors, the DL380p Gen8 provides the processing capability required for virtualization, databases, web applications, file services, and other enterprise workloads.</p><p><br></p><p>The server supports DDR3 HP SmartMemory and a variety of SFF and LFF storage configurations, allowing users to prioritize either storage capacity or performance. RAID options through HP Smart Array controllers provide flexible data protection and storage management.</p><p><br></p><p>With HP iLO 4, PCIe expansion, flexible networking, and redundant power supply options, the DL380p Gen8 offers a practical platform for a wide range of business and data center applications.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>HP ProLiant DL380p Gen8 2U Rack Server</li><li>Dual-socket Intel Xeon E5-2600 processor support</li><li>DDR3 HP SmartMemory support</li><li>Flexible SFF and LFF storage configurations</li><li>SAS and SATA drive support</li><li>HP Smart Array RAID controller options</li><li>HP iLO 4 remote server management</li><li>PCIe expansion capability</li><li>Multiple Ethernet networking options</li><li>Redundant power supply support</li><li>Scalable enterprise server architecture</li><li>Suitable for virtualization and storage workloads</li><li>Designed for data center and business environments</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 Server","href":"/hpe-proliant-dl380-gen10-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL180 Gen9 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl180-gen9-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL380 Gen9","href":"/hp-proliant-dl380-gen9","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HPE ProLiant DL360 Gen10 Server","href":"/hpe-proliant-dl360-gen10-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL360